# Issue #129: moved from app/.dockerignore -- the Docker build context is now the repo root
# (azure.yaml's docker.context: ..), and Docker only reads .dockerignore from the context root,
# so an app/.dockerignore would silently stop applying.
.git

# Backend
**/*.pyc
**/.env

## Will be built by multistage docker build
**/static

# Frontend
**/node_modules

# Persona menu source workbooks (raw ingestion spreadsheets, not needed at runtime -- see
# scripts/sonic_menu_ingestion_search.ipynb / setup_search_index.py, which only ever read the
# already-transformed personas/<id>/menu/menuItems.json)
personas/*/menu/source/
